OL,3,GNEWSAPriest pleads guilty to 109 sex
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA priest has pleaded guilty to 109 sex
OL,7,Foffences at Londonderry Crown Court.
OL,9,FEdward Gallagher, 59, whose address is
OL,10,FMaghaberry Prison, will be sentenced in
OL,11,FDecember for offences between 22 June
OL,12,F2023 and 18 April 2025.
OL,14,FThey include among others attempted
OL,15,Fsexual communication with a child under
OL,16,F16, having indecent images of a child,
OL,17,Fpossessing an extreme pornographic
OL,18,Fimage and attempting to encourage a
OL,19,Fchild to engage in sexual activity.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
