OL,3,GNEWSAPriest pleads guilty to 109 sex
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Catholic Bishop of Derry Michael
OL,7,FRouter confirmed that he would ask the
OL,8,FVatican to dismiss Gallagher from the
OL,9,Fpriesthood.
